ine un abile ribaltamento dei giochi, consentendo a Masamune un netto vantaggio su tutti gli altri generali.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Keji Maeda, il messaggero!","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"62103","synopsis":"Free-spirited Keiji hopes to build an alliance against the threat of the Demon Lord. His visit with Uesugi ends on a promising note - but his meeting with Date Masamune leads to a battle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/538371.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Keji Maeda, il messaggero!","synopsis":"Free-spirited Keiji hopes to build an alliance against the threat of the Demon Lord. His visit with Uesugi ends on a promising note - but his meeting with Date Masamune leads to a battle.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Keji Maeda,il messaggero!","synopsis":"La minaccia di Oda Nobunaga è seria, così un messaggero, Keiji Maeda, viaggia di regione in regione per radunare tutti i generali delle diverse zone e riunirli in un unico esercito.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Il tremante fiore scarlatto - La lealtà portatrice di dolore!","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"62104","synopsis":"The alliance is gathering strength; former rivals are united in the march to war against Oda. Unfortunately, the plan could be doomed without the cooperation and troops of Azai Nagamasa - Oda’s brother-in-law.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/538381.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il tremante fiore scarlatto - La lealtà portatrice di dolore!","synopsis":"The alliance is gathering strength; former rivals are united in the march to war against Oda. Unfortunately, the plan could be doomed without the cooperation and troops of Azai Nagamasa - Oda’s brother-in-law.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Il tremante fiore scarlatto - La lealtà portatrice di dolore!","synopsis":"Lord Masamune si dirige da solo contro Oda. Dietro di loro Shingen Takeda, la Tigre del Kai, e Kenshin Uesugi si muovono verso Nagashino per scontrarsi con il clan Tokugawa.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Eroico! Crociata sulla pianura Shitaraga di Nagashino","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"62105","synopsis":"As entire armies stand poised to attack, Takeda and Uesugi offer Tokugawa a final chance to join forces against Oda - but once his loyalties are decided, a ruthless betrayal soaks the battlefield in blood.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/538391.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Eroico! Crociata sulla pianura Shitaraga di Nagashino","synopsis":"As entire armies stand poised to attack, Takeda and Uesugi offer Tokugawa a final chance to join forces against Oda - but once his loyalties are decided, a ruthless betrayal soaks the battlefield in blood.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Eroico! Crociata sulla pianura Shitaraga di Nagashino","synopsis":"La Tigre del Kai, giunto a Nagashino, cerca un accordo con Ieyasu, alleato di Nobunaga, per portarlo dalla sua parte. I suoi sforzi sono però vani e lo scontro tra i due eserciti sembra ormai imminente.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Legami infranti, lo sfortunato ritiro di Masamune!","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"62106","synopsis":"After he rises to defend the honor of the fallen Azai, Date Masamune orders his forces to retreat. However, Sanada is shocked to discover it might already be too late for the warrior to survive.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/561801.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Legami infranti, lo sfortunato ritiro di Masamune!","synopsis":"After he rises to defend the honor of the fallen Azai, Date Masamune orders his forces to retreat. However, Sanada is shocked to discover it might already be too late for the warrior to survive.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Legami infranti,lo sfortunato ritiro di Masamune!","synopsis":"Nagamasa è caduto nella trappola di Mitsuhide e in punto di morte fa anche una triste scoperta... Sul campo di battaglia resta ormai solo Masamune Date.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Il saccheggio del villano! Due draghi duellano sotto il chiaro di luna","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"62107","synopsis":"Matsunaga takes three of Date’s men hostage and demands a ransom of rare and valuable weaponry. Katakura sets out to rescue the men - but he might not be able to do it alone.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/697561.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il saccheggio del villano! Due draghi duellano sotto il chiaro di luna","synopsis":"Matsunaga takes three of Date’s men hostage and demands a ransom of rare and valuable weaponry. Katakura sets out to rescue the men - but he might not be able to do it alone.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Il saccheggio del villano! Due draghi duellano sotto il chiaro di luna","synopsis":"Il rapimento di alcuni dei fedelissimi di Masamune Date scuote il riposo di Katakura. Gli ostaggi saranno restituiti al proprio esercito solo dopo il pagamento di un riscatto. Ma la richiesta è inammissibile.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Il Grande Tempio di Sangue e Sento! Kojurou in una situazione disperata","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"62108","synopsis":"Katakura, Sanada, and Sarutobi arrive with the treasures requested by Matsunaga, who betrays his word and attacks the hostages.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/697571.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il Grande Tempio di Sangue e Sento! Kojurou in una situazione disperata","synopsis":"Katakura, Sanada, and Sarutobi arrive with the treasures requested by Matsunaga, who betrays his word and attacks the hostages.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Il Grande Tempio di Sangue e Sento! Kojurou in una situazione disperata","synopsis":"Katakura è giunto al cospetto di Hisahide Matsunaga per contrattare la liberazione dei suoi uomini. Tra i resti di un glorioso passato, numerose insidie metteranno a dura prova il coraggioso Katakura.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"La Tigre del Kai muore a Midaigawa","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6284","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5355","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25492","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87881","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"62109","synopsis":"Oda’s army is on the move in the south, while his most lethal assassins strike the opposition leaders of the east. As Takeda and Uesugi fight for their lives, many loyal to the alliance meet their demise.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87881/697581.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"La Tigre del Kai muore a Midaigawa","synopsis":"Oda’s army is on the move in the south, while his most lethal assassins strike the opposition leaders of the east. As Takeda and Uesugi fight for their lives, many loyal to the alliance meet their demise.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage